 "title": "前排拦截",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 124.2,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "从早到晚，能拦钱的地方排成一列。",
   "spoken": "从早到晚，能拦钱的地方排成一列。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.032,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.793
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "最靠前的，是协议自己的暂停和延迟提款。",
   "spoken": "最靠前的，是协议自己的暂停和延迟提款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.852,
   "dur": 4.512,
   "speechStart": 5.95,
   "speechEnd": 9.533
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "条件是合约里事先设计了暂停或延迟机制，而且有人值守。",
   "spoken": "条件是合约里事先设计了暂停或延迟机制，而且有人值守。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.584,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 10.682,
   "speechEnd": 15.694
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "Bybit 被盗后，mETH Protocol 靠 8 小时的提款延迟，暂停了合约，追回约 4300 万美元的 cmETH。",
   "spoken": "Bybit 被盗后，mETH Protocol 靠 8 小时的提款延迟，暂停了合约，追回约 4300 万美元的 cmETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.732,
   "dur": 8.352,
   "speechStart": 16.83,
   "speechEnd": 24.258
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "这是那次事件里，追回最多的单项。",
   "spoken": "这是那次事件里，追回最多的单项。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 25.304,
   "dur": 3.504,
   "speechStart": 25.402,
   "speechEnd": 27.973
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "第二道，是稳定币发行方冻结。",
   "spoken": "第二道，是稳定币发行方冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 29.028,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 29.126,
   "speechEnd": 31.59
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "Tether、Circle 这类发行方，可以在合约层面冻结一个地址。",
   "spoken": "Tether、Circle 这类发行方，可以在合约层面冻结一个地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.656,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 32.754,
   "speechEnd": 36.992
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "2024 年 9 月，Tether、TRON 和 TRM 联合成立了 T3 金融犯罪部门。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 9 月，Tether、TRON 和 TRM 联合成立了 T3 金融犯罪部门。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.06,
   "dur": 6.552,
   "speechStart": 38.158,
   "speechEnd": 43.777
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "2026 年 5 月，T3 自报累计冻结 4.5 亿美元以上。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 5 月，T3 自报垒计冻结 4.5 亿美元以上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 44.832,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 44.93,
   "speechEnd": 49.192
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "可这条路，有门槛，有时延，也可能被撤销。",
   "spoken": "可这条路，有门槛，有时延，也可能被撤销。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 50.26,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 50.358,
   "speechEnd": 54.096
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "门槛是，通常要有执法请求或法院命令。",
   "spoken": "门槛是，通常要有执法请求或法院命令。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 55.136,
   "dur": 4.608,
   "speechStart": 55.234,
   "speechEnd": 58.912
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "撤销的例子，是 2025 年 5 月的 LIBRA 案。",
   "spoken": "撤销的例子，是 2025 年 5 月的 LIBRA 案。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 59.964,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 60.062,
   "speechEnd": 63.704
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "Circle 依据纽约南区法院的临时限制令，冻结了约 5760 万美元 USDC。",
   "spoken": "Circle 依据纽约南区法院的临时限制令，冻结了约 5760 万美元 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 64.744,
   "dur": 7.104,
   "speechStart": 64.842,
   "speechEnd": 70.996
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "8 月，法官解除了冻结，理由是原告没有证明不可弥补的损害。",
   "spoken": "8 月，法官解除了冻结，理由是原告没有证明不可弥补的损害。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 72.068,
   "dur": 6.504,
   "speechStart": 72.166,
   "speechEnd": 77.725
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "时延的例子，是 2026 年 4 月的 Drift 被盗事件。",
   "spoken": "时延的例子，是 2026 年 4 月的 Drift 被盗事件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 78.792,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 78.89,
   "speechEnd": 82.449
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "链上调查者 ZachXBT，公开批评 Circle 延迟了约 6 小时，期间约 2.32 亿美元经跨链协议转走。",
   "spoken": "链上掉查者 ZachXBT，公开批评 Circle 延迟了约 6 小时，期间约 2.32 亿美元经跨链协议转走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 83.5,
   "dur": 9.192,
   "speechStart": 83.598,
   "speechEnd": 91.86
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "这是个人指控，未见 Circle 回应。",
   "spoken": "这是个人指控，未见 Circle 回应。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 92.912,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 93.01,
   "speechEnd": 95.438
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "美国 GENIUS 法案在 2025 年 7 月成为法律，要求支付型稳定币发行方，有能力执行冻结、扣押、阻止转账这类合法命令。",
   "spoken": "美国 GENIUS 法案在 2025 年 7 月成为法律，要求支付型稳定币发行方，有能力执行冻结、扣押、阻止转账这类合法命令。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 96.492,
   "dur": 11.352,
   "speechStart": 96.59,
   "speechEnd": 107.006
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "第三道，是交易所冻结。",
   "spoken": "第三道，是交易所冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 108.064,
   "dur": 3.048,
   "speechStart": 108.162,
   "speechEnd": 110.281
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "条件是交易所收到可信的地址清单，或者风控名单命中，时效在小时级。",
   "spoken": "条件是交易所收到可信的地址清单，或者风控名单命中，时效在小时级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 111.332,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 111.43,
   "speechEnd": 117.442
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "局限也很明显，攻击者会避开合规交易所。",
   "spoken": "局限也很明显，攻击者会避开合规交易所。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 118.512,
